<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S DOUBLES FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S DOUBLES FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of women's doubles final at</p>
<p>the Wimbledon tennis championships on Sunday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Gigi Fernandez (U.S.)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat 6-Nicole</p>
<p>Arendt (U.S.)/Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands) 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
</text>
